		(descr "Vishay TEPT4400 ambient light phototransistor, T-1 (3mm) THT package. Dimensions per Vishay datasheet doc 81341 rev 1.8 (30-Jun-16), drawing 6.544-5054.01-4: body dia 3mm (housing 3.2mm), lead pitch 2.54mm nominal, lead dia 0.4-0.5mm. Pin assignment: datasheet package-dimensions top view shows leads left-to-right as E, C -- pad 1 (matches Device:Q_Photo_NPN pin 1 = Collector) placed on the RIGHT, pad 2 (Emitter) on the LEFT. DNP in PCB v1 -- populate only if bench-testing this sensor instead of the LDR. Verify polarity visually before hand-soldering.")
